# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: SiblingHintHonestSplitHintAboveHeads
TARGET: SiblingHintHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the split hands the sibling the exclusive head as an inclusive hint (#5760)
PERTURBS: SplitCommit
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitHint = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1

--- FIND
    /\ sibHint' = sh[a] - 1
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the exclusive head as the hint.
    /\ sibHint' = sh[a]
--- END
